# --- large media sources -------------------------------------------------
# Keep these on disk, out of git history. Once a big binary is committed it
# stays in every clone forever, even if you delete the file later.
#
# NOTE: core.ignorecase is true on macOS, so these patterns already match any
# capitalisation. Do not add an uppercase twin like *.MP4, it would also
# swallow the lowercase pendulum.mp4 that the site actually serves.

# Camera originals. The site serves the compressed exports instead.
*.mov

# Superseded: replaced by pendulum.mp4 + pendulum.webm (31 MB -> 4 MB).
media/pendulum.gif
